al same-color groups using\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:292:    aligned-and-clear centroid connectivity, then process each local group\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:293:    independently. Order a group's centroids by angle, pick the start centroid\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:295:    between consecutive centroids, and draw parallel offset copies for the carried\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:301:    connectivity between those centroids.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:391:    Expand each same-color shape by connecting its vertex-block centroids and copy\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:392:    any different-color neighbor of the chosen start centroid along parallel lines.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:396:    with integer centroids. A main color may be reused by multiple spatially\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:398:    the 8-neighborhood of one centroid. Optional distractors stay unchanged.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:402:    them to centroids, split the centroids into local same-color groups using\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:403:    aligned-and-clear centroid connectivity, then process each local group\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:404:    independently. Order a group's centroids by angle, pick the start centroid\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:406:    between consecutive centroids, and draw parallel offset copies for the carried\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/25/code.py:412:    connectivity between those centroids.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/31/code.py:37:#      usually horizontal only: blank outer columns disappear, producing a narrow\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/c