:263:    - Position the copy by aligning the frame's geometric center (its bbox center)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/37/code.py:112:    Remove isolated specks and one-cell protrusions before dent detection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/37/code.py:209:      isolated specks disappear to black and wrong-color boundary protrusions\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/7/code.py:11:#      dst holes by centroid row/col rank, and copies the src fill color directly.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/17/code.py:11:#    - Combo behavior: perform the same centroid-rank matching, but now do a bidirectional\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/17/code.py:31:#    - Matching stays the original centroid-rank rule; this preserves the original inference\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/17/code.py:41:#    - Storing only `src` centroids/colors is insufficient; src rewriting also needs each src\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/17/code.py:61:#    - No ordering depends on raw color ids; pairing still depends only on visible centroid ranks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/17/code.py:79:#      rotation/flip search for robust matching by centroid ranks, but the generator does not rely\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8698868d/D1/5/code.py:14:#     - The key is no longer the raw count; it is the hole-layout signature formed from hole-centroid row/col ranks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8698868d/D1/5/code.py:28:#       Replace it with a layout signature computed from enclosed-hole centroids.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8698868d/D1/5/code.py:99:def _rank_signature(centroids: list[tuple[float, float]]) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], ...]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8698868d/D1/5/code.py:100:    if not centroids:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8698868d/D1/5/code.py:103:    row_vals = _compress_values([float(r) for r, _c in centroids])\n/home/